<title>UK: EIB sets $300 million 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets $300 million 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    16.JUN.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    16.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR U.S.T</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
